## 🚀 Overview

**Ashley Furniture – Product Data Extraction** is a Python-based web scraping and browser automation project developed as part of a **Technical / Data Research Assignment**.

The project focuses on processing **198 Ashley Furniture SKUs**, finding the corresponding product pages, validating product SKUs, extracting available product information, and saving the results into Excel.

The automation uses **Selenium** for browser-based interaction and **Pandas / OpenPyXL** for Excel data processing.

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement

The provided Excel file contains **198 Ashley Furniture product SKUs**.

Manually searching each SKU and collecting product information is time-consuming and can lead to data-entry errors.

The required product information includes:

* SKU
* Product URL
* Product Image
* Description
* Color
* Price
* Series Name
* UPC
* Product Dimensions
* Carton Dimensions
* Other available product details

The goal is to automate this process as much as possible while validating the extracted data.

---

## 💡 Solution

A Selenium-based browser automation workflow was developed to search and collect product information from Ashley Furniture.

### Automation Flow

```text
Excel File
    ↓
Read SKU
    ↓
Open Ashley Furniture
    ↓
Search SKU
    ↓
Find Product URL
    ↓
Open Product Page
    ↓
Validate SKU
    ↓
Extract Product Data
    ↓
Save Results to Excel
```

---

## ✨ Features

### 📊 Excel Processing

* Reads the provided Excel file
* Verifies the available SKUs
* Processes SKU information
* Stores extracted results in Excel
* Handles missing values as `N/A`

### 🌐 Web Scraping

* Searches Ashley Furniture products
* Finds matching product pages
* Opens product pages using Selenium
* Extracts available product information
* Collects product image URLs where available

### 🤖 Browser Automation

* Selenium browser automation
* Chrome browser interaction
* Location popup handling
* Cookie popup handling
* Product-page navigation
* Search automation

### ✅ Data Validation

* Compares Excel SKU with website SKU
* Validates product matching
* Prevents incorrect product records
* Records unavailable information as `N/A`

