---

## ⚠️ Current Challenge

Initially, Python `requests` was used to access Ashley Furniture product pages.

The website returned:

```text
HTTP 406
```

Because the direct HTTP request did not provide the required page content, the approach was changed to **Selenium browser automation**.

During product-page navigation, Ashley Furniture may sometimes display a human-verification prompt such as:

```text
Press & Hold to confirm you are a human.
```

This can interrupt continuous automated processing.

The human-verification mechanism was **not bypassed**. The project treats this as an external website restriction and requires manual interaction when it occurs.

