Install the required packages using:

```bash
pip install selenium pandas openpyxl
```

---

## ▶️ How to Run

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/surajks25/Ashley-Furniture---Technical-Data-Research-Assignment-.git
```

### 2. Open the Project

```bash
cd Ashley-Furniture---Technical-Data-Research-Assignment-
```

### 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install selenium pandas openpyxl
```

### 4. Run the Extraction Script

```bash
python product_extract_all.py
```

The script reads the input Excel file, processes the SKUs, extracts available product information, and saves the results into the output Excel file.

